		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p data-start="169" data-end="462">The <strong data-start="173" data-end="199">Department of Pharmacy</strong> is committed to excellence in pharmaceutical education, research, and healthcare services. Our mission is to nurture future pharmacists and researchers who can meet the dynamic challenges of the pharmaceutical industry, clinical practice, and regulatory affairs.</p>
<p data-start="464" data-end="778">The department offers a blend of theoretical knowledge and practical training through state-of-the-art laboratories, experienced faculty, and industry collaborations. Emphasis is placed on pharmaceutical sciences, including drug formulation, pharmacology, medicinal chemistry, pharmacognosy, and clinical pharmacy.</p>

